{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"＼ででーん／"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2012/12/30/7367793/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"この子に見覚えある人挙手！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"...て、近すぎてわからない？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2012/12/30/7367793/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私のソファーで\nくつろいじゃってるよ。\nもうみんなと仲良しなんだよ。\nニコちゃんとトリケラトプスと\nステゴサウルスにはさまれてるよ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ここで問題。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"...\nこの子にはちゃんとした名前が\nあります。私が考えたわけでは\nありません。\nさて、何という名前でしょう。\n..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"......って問題にしようと思ったけど\nあまりにも難し過ぎるでしょう..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"だってさ！\n私が考えた名前じゃないわけだし！\n一発でわかったら天才だよ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まさか名前が「べにいも」ちゃん\nだなんて！紅芋って和風な！\n色が紅色だから紅芋なんだけども\nべにい..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あ、言っちゃった。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そうです。正解は\n「べにいも」ちゃんです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"個人pvで私が抱きかかえながら\n歌って最後のポイッてしてしまった\nぬいぐるみです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"撮影でこの子にお世話になりました。\n撮影終わったあと、\nスタッフさんからいただきました; ;\nありがとうございました...！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ハンドメイドのものだそうです。\nぞんびの中でも種類はけだもの。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"詳しくは「ぞんび商店」で検索♪\n全部くちびるが愛らしいです。\n...けだものめっちゃかわいい"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2012/12/30/7367793/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"......"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"乃木ここ見てくださった方、\n感想ありがとうございました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"焼肉忘年会でした。\nタン塩が食べたくて\n魔法をかけちゃうぞチームに\nちょっと譲ってもらいました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"見てない方はぜひ見てください！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"**********"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2012/12/30/7367793/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"年越しそばは毎年食べてる？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2012/12/30/7367793/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"食べるよー！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2012/12/30/7367793/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"サイリウム何色がいいのー？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2012/12/30/7367793/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そういうのってやっぱ\n決めといた方が良いんかなあ？！\n何色でも嬉しいですよ><"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2012/12/30/7367793/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"O型っぽいのは\nズバリどんなところ？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2012/12/30/7367793/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"おおざっぱなくせに\nおせっかいで心配性\n空気読めない\nメールの返信が遅い"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まあ私はO型の代表ですよ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2012/12/30/7367793/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"っけ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2012/12/30/7367793/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"乃木ここで皆からいじられてる感じ\nだったけど、普段も\nそんな感じなのかな？(笑)"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2012/12/30/7367793/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いじられるのに反応が\n悪くて反省してます。。\nらりんとかもうあのまんまだよ！笑\nいや、メンバーあのまんまだよ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2012/12/30/7367793/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"アジカンでどの曲が一番好き？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2012/12/30/7367793/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"入れてあるもの何曲は聴いたけど\n一曲に絞れない"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2012/12/30/7367793/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"フラッシュバック\nラストダンスは悲しみに乗せて\nリライト\n振動覚\nソラニン\n未来の破片"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2012/12/30/7367793/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"年が変わる瞬間にジャンプして、\nこの時地球にいなかったんだー！\nっていう遊びしたことある？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2012/12/30/7367793/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"去年一人でぴょんと。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2012/12/30/7367793/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ニキビとかできにくい\nほうなのかな？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2012/12/30/7367793/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"もともとできにくい方だけど\n高校生になってから全くできない"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2012/12/30/7367793/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2012/12/30/7367793/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"オススメのファンデとかリップ\nおしえてほしいなっ(((o(*ﾟ▽ﾟ*)o)))"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2012/12/30/7367793/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"使ってるファンデは\nオンリーミネラル\nリップクリームは\nNEWAYSのLipceuticalと\nSKINFOODの色付きリップバーム"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"またまとめてメイク道具載せます！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2012/12/30/7367793/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最後の画像の表情の\nテーマはずばり？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2012/12/30/7367793/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"アンニュイ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2012/12/30/7367793/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お餅食べる時\nお雑煮にするのと焼いて食べるの\nどっちが好き？？？＼(^o^)／"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2012/12/30/7367793/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お雑煮とか、ぺったんぺったん\nしたお餅がすき！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2012/12/30/7367793/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"家は布団なん？\nベットなイメージやった！！"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2012/12/30/7367793/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ん？ロフトベッドだよー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2012/12/30/7367793/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ねねころがこんなに\n大きくなったらどうする？(笑)"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2012/12/30/7367793/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"やだ！やだ！！\nねねがねねじゃなくなる！！！！←"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2012/12/30/7367793/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"受験生のとき、\n気をつけてたことってある？？？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2012/12/30/7367793/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"風邪菌もらわないように\nあんまり外に出てなかったかも..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2012/12/30/7367793/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"受験終わったから握手会\nとかで会いにいっていい？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2012/12/30/7367793/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"もちろん"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2012/12/30/7367793/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ずっと待ってます。\n受験生のみなさん...\n頑張ってください！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2012/12/30/7367793/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"年下のメンバーで\n誰が一番おもしろいですか？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2012/12/30/7367793/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちはるーん"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2012/12/30/7367793/0009.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2012/12/30/7367793/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"乃木ここで異様に耳だけ\n赤かった気がしたんだけど気のせい？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2012/12/30/7367793/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"メンバーといると耳赤なるんよ//\nもしかしたら熱あったんかなあ？←"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"**********"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2012/12/30/7367793/0010.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"来年のスケジュール帳ね。\nシンプルでしょ！\nねねはこれの薄ピンク。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"明日は今年最後のお買い物だ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2012/12/30/7367793/0011.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"良いものに出会えますように！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"おやすみなさい"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まりか"}],"source":"archive"}